{
	"title": "One of the secrets behind more consistent AI content? JSON Prompting.",
	"blocks": {
		"c04a3eeb26a8": [
			{
				"_key": "6065700940790",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "In my search for the best ways to communicate with generative AI, whether to create new content, write code quickly, automate my tasks or brainstorm, I kept running into more and more challenges. Every attempt pushed me to rework my prompts, sometimes to the point of exhaustion. "
			}
		],
		"9fc525470e2f": [
			{
				"_key": "f006dee3e5d80",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "I realized that talking to GenAI in natural language is, of course, the most intuitive approach. After all, these tools are designed to understand and produce human language. But as I kept experimenting, after trying a thousand and one ways to phrase my requests, I understood that it was becoming crucial to be more consistent and structured in my interactions."
			}
		],
		"411d66a4f967": [
			{
				"_key": "ead67a6e5bba0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "And that’s when, during a late-night research session, I stumbled on a technique that changed everything: JSON Prompting."
			}
		],
		"47650dcc86c7": [
			{
				"_key": "d9a0e1f9854e0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "In this article, I’m sharing the tips I’ve picked up thanks to JSON Prompting"
			}
		],
		"0c64ce78a285": [
			{
				"_key": "9670a073854e0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "#1 First things first: what exactly is JSON?"
			}
		],
		"f67a8f8e72af": [
			{
				"_key": "f0d944a9c9810",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Don’t panic. We’re not going to dive into incomprehensible code."
			}
		],
		"4575b09811cb": [
			{
				"_key": "61f97510f40f0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "The "
			},
			{
				"_key": "61f97510f40f1",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "JSON"
			},
			{
				"_key": "61f97510f40f2",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": " format (JavaScript Object Notation) is just a way of organizing information into clear blocks, a bit like boxes to fill in:"
			}
		],
		"cc4fbe8f858b": [
			{
				"_key": "23a7c6d12bee0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "JSON is "
			},
			{
				"_key": "23a7c6d12bee1",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "commonly used for storing and transferring data in the software development world."
			}
		],
		"492c18143a6f": [
			{
				"_key": "9c2903fec0c60",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "The good news is that AI loves it. It’s clear, it’s precise, and it avoids misunderstandings or vague answers.  "
			}
		],
		"6ca2ff2c88c7": [
			{
				"_key": "784acd6b36290",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "#2 Why is it useful?"
			}
		],
		"210069795073": [
			{
				"_key": "804ee4307ca90",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "At some point, simply asking "
			},
			{
				"_key": "804ee4307ca91",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"em"
				],
				"text": "“Make me a cool video to promote our app”"
			},
			{
				"_key": "804ee4307ca92",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "… well, it’s just not enough anymore."
			}
		],
		"b7a187004832": [
			{
				"_key": "fb816d53651d0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "The AI will do what it can, but you need results that are "
			},
			{
				"_key": "fb816d53651d1",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "clear"
			},
			{
				"_key": "fb816d53651d2",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": ", "
			},
			{
				"_key": "fb816d53651d3",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "consistent"
			},
			{
				"_key": "fb816d53651d4",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": " and "
			},
			{
				"_key": "fb816d53651d5",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "reusable"
			},
			{
				"_key": "fb816d53651d6",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "."
			}
		],
		"fb27beffb46f": [
			{
				"_key": "dc5dc07f8c120",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "That’s where "
			},
			{
				"_key": "dc5dc07f8c121",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "JSON Prompting"
			},
			{
				"_key": "dc5dc07f8c122",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": " is a game changer: it’s not just a format, it’s a method."
			}
		],
		"0b175be3587b": [
			{
				"_key": "8b0d9b57b1c10",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "1. It’s clear and structured"
			}
		],
		"28f6ef529067": [
			{
				"_key": "f0ffa7acaa0b0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Instead of giving a vague instruction, you can write a complete brief, like this one:"
			}
		],
		"0dc6cd7d9b16": [
			{
				"_key": "fbfadcd93ec10",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "2. It’s ready for automation"
			}
		],
		"07f32f2a230f": [
			{
				"_key": "e7befd8dce130",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "If you use tools like "
			},
			{
				"_key": "e7befd8dce131",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "Zapier"
			},
			{
				"_key": "e7befd8dce132",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": ", "
			},
			{
				"_key": "e7befd8dce133",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "Make"
			},
			{
				"_key": "e7befd8dce134",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": " or even an "
			},
			{
				"_key": "e7befd8dce135",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "Airtable"
			},
			{
				"_key": "e7befd8dce136",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": " base, this JSON format is ready to use as is."
			}
		],
		"ece84b3dd637": [
			{
				"_key": "78ec99c9e33a0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "You can automate the creation of several videos from a database."
			}
		],
		"ede61ec0a510": [
			{
				"_key": "27ae8299578a0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "📌 For example, a table with 10 scripts = 10 different videos, generated with no manual intervention."
			}
		],
		"35b12aab25dd": [
			{
				"_key": "48b0d8c855190",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "3. It can be duplicated endlessly"
			}
		],
		"7d580350b4f4": [
			{
				"_key": "2b1d505b74330",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "A well-structured prompt becomes a "
			},
			{
				"_key": "2b1d505b74331",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "recipe"
			},
			{
				"_key": "2b1d505b74332",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "."
			}
		],
		"73a19df25306": [
			{
				"_key": "a11bf4a711be0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "You can reuse it, adapt it, translate it… while keeping everything consistent."
			}
		],
		"22bb3af9c70d": [
			{
				"_key": "1591c8581a6d0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "A short version for TikTok"
			}
		],
		"5ca20c8a27af": [
			{
				"_key": "8946785b61760",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "A long version for YouTube"
			}
		],
		"da74427a92df": [
			{
				"_key": "a213777fa3420",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "A localized version for each French-speaking African country"
			}
		],
		"e28dcc20af65": [
			{
				"_key": "38f37b7dde090",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "👉 You go from an “"
			},
			{
				"_key": "20476006bbbc",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "assistant"
			},
			{
				"_key": "58a3284edfbc",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "” AI to an AI that’s a "
			},
			{
				"_key": "38f37b7dde091",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "production partner."
			}
		],
		"17ccdde68092": [
			{
				"_key": "72265408d8d50",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "4. Better alignment with LLM DNA"
			}
		],
		"efbd781c49de": [
			{
				"_key": "24c69c483f600",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Models like GPT, Claude or Gemini were heavily trained on code, configuration files, API responses... in short, "
			},
			{
				"_key": "24c69c483f601",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "structures that look like JSON"
			},
			{
				"_key": "24c69c483f602",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "."
			}
		],
		"4d558839757a": [
			{
				"_key": "1f311b13dada",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "👉 "
			},
			{
				"_key": "83a0f7cf9cab",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [
					"strong"
				],
				"text": "The result?"
			},
			{
				"_key": "c0cd1250396f",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": " They naturally understand these formats and respond to them with far more precision than to free-form text."
			}
		],
		"c616d287dc1e": [
			{
				"_key": "aa347f8af96a0",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "#3 Best practices (no need to be a dev)"
			}
		],
		"71423cfdd2db": [
			{
				"_key": "5abd957f57f2",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "Here are a few simple pointers to get off to a good start:"
			}
		],
		"f6d82b6197f4": [
			{
				"_key": "3304693087970",
				"_type": "span",
				"marks": [],
				"text": "1. Think clearly"
			}
		],
